---
---

<section id="experience" class="py-20 bg-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">Experience</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A journey through building exceptional user experiences and leading high-performing teams 
        across enterprise-scale applications and design systems.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Experience Item 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-700">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Senior Director of Engineering</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-400 font-medium mb-2">IHS Markit (now S&P Global)</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400">2019 - Present</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full text-sm">Leadership</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300">
          <p>
            Leading engineering initiatives across multiple product teams, focusing on design systems, 
            user experience, and scalable architecture. Built and maintained the Cupcake Design System 
            serving 80+ applications and millions of users.
          </p>
          
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Key Achievements</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  38% reduction in time to market for new features
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Built comprehensive design system with 150+ components
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Led team of 12+ engineers and designers
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  9+ point increase in usability scores
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Technologies</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">React</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Angular</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Storybook</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Figma</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">SCSS</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Item 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-700">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Senior UX Developer</h3>
            <p class="text-purple-400 font-medium mb-2">IHS Markit</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400">2017 - 2019</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-600/20 text-purple-400 rounded-full text-sm">UX Development</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300">
          <p>
            Focused on building user-centered interfaces and establishing design system foundations. 
            Collaborated closely with design teams to create seamless user experiences across 
            enterprise financial applications.
          </p>
          
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Key Achievements</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Established initial design system architecture
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Created component library with 50+ reusable components
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Improved user satisfaction by 25%
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Mentored junior developers on UX best practices
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Technologies</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">JavaScript</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">HTML5</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">CSS3</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Sketch</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">jQuery</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Bootstrap</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Item 3 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-700">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Frontend Developer</h3>
            <p class="text-pink-400 font-medium mb-2">Various Companies</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400">2016 - 2017</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600/20 text-pink-400 rounded-full text-sm">Development</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300">
          <p>
            Built responsive web applications and collaborated with design teams to implement 
            pixel-perfect user interfaces. Gained expertise in modern JavaScript frameworks 
            and established foundations in user experience design.
          </p>
          
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Key Achievements</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Developed 20+ responsive web applications
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Improved page load times by 40%
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Implemented accessibility best practices
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
                  Collaborated with cross-functional teams
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Technologies</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">React</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Vue.js</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">JavaScript</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">SASS</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Webpack</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded text-xs">Git</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
